---
import "@/styles/global.css";
import "@/styles/about/community.css";
import Navigation from "@/components/Navigation.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="description" content="QUT AI & ML Community" /><title>Community | QUT AI & ML Society</title></head>
  <body class="background-dots"><Navigation />
    <main class="community-page"><section class="community-hero"><div class="community-shell"><p>OUR COMMUNITY</p><h1>Find your<br /><span>people.</span></h1><div><p>The QUT AI &amp; ML Society brings together students interested in artificial intelligence and machine learning through social events, technical workshops, and industry focused talks.</p><a href="https://discord.gg/CqkUzVVkXX" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the Discord <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></div></section>
      <section class="community-story"><div class="community-shell community-story-grid"><div class="community-copy"><p class="community-kicker">A PLACE TO START</p><h2>Built around<br /><span>showing up.</span></h2><p>Our events are designed to be welcoming to everyone, from beginners exploring AI for the first time to students building portfolios and working on real world machine learning projects.</p><p>We run hands on workshops, collaborative study sessions, social catch ups, and panel discussions, and regularly collaborate with other technology and innovation focused societies across QUT and the wider Brisbane community.</p></div><figure><img src="/community.png" alt="QUT AI & ML Society event" /><figcaption>QUT AIML community</figcaption></figure></div></section>
      <section class="community-actions"><div class="community-shell"><div class="community-actions-heading"><p>WAYS TO TAKE PART</p><h2>Make it<br /><span>yours.</span></h2></div><div class="community-action-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Come along</h3><p>The easiest way to get involved is by attending regular events and staying afterwards to chat with other members.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Stay connected</h3><p>Discord is the main place to ask questions, share opportunities, and stay connected between events.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Help shape AIML</h3><p>Committee and subcommittee opportunities are advertised through social media and newsletters. Members are encouraged to nominate at the Annual General Meeting.</p></article></div></div></section>
      <section class="community-speaker"><div class="community-shell"><div><p>SHARE WHAT YOU KNOW</p><h2>Giving<br /><span>talks.</span></h2></div><div><p>Giving a talk at a QUT AI &amp; ML Society event is a great way to share knowledge and build confidence speaking about technical topics. Past talks have covered machine learning fundamentals, applied AI projects, natural language processing, and emerging tools and frameworks.</p><a href="mailto:qut-aiml@outlook.com">Talk with AIML <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></div></div></section>
      <section class="community-links"><div class="community-shell"><p>KEEP UP WITH AIML</p><div><a href="https://discord.gg/CqkUzVVkXX" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/qut-aiml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/qut_aiml/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/qut-aiml/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div></section>
    </main><Footer />
  </body>
</html>
